  "abstract": "<jats:p>We report a push-pull Mach-Zehnder modulator in a 300-mm CMOS silicon photonics foundry with 60 GHz EO bandwidth. We demonstrate 2.9 dB TDECQ and 3.7 dB ER in 200 Gbps PAM-4 transmissions with 7-tap FFE.</jats:p>",
